  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>The SOLUNA NZ Affiliate Partner Program is an integrity-led affiliate opportunity designed for individuals who genuinely value holistic wellness, frequency-based tools, and conscious living.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>This program is not MLM and does not involve recruitment or downlines. Affiliates earn commission by sharing SOLUNA products from personal experience, supported by brand-approved education, assets, and ongoing support.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Affiliates are considered brand partners, not promoters, and represent SOLUNA NZ - a conscious wellness brand focused on frequency, grounding, and integrity-driven growth.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>What You'll Promote:</span></strong><span> SOLUNA Frequency Devices (7.83Hz Earth/Schumann resonance), SOLUNA Herbal Products (Blue Lotus, Soursop Leaf), SOLUNA Wellness Bundles &amp; Sets, and future events and digital offerings.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>What You'll Receive:</span></strong><span> 20% commission on qualifying sales, unique tracking link, official brand assets &amp; captions, educational product guidance, first access to new launches, ongoing team support, and no sales quotas.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal